{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Thank you · AfterMe{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Thank you</h1>
<p>You are now a trusted contact for {{ inviter_name }}. There is nothing more to do, and you don't need to install anything.</p>
<p>If {{ inviter_name }} misses a check-in and doesn't respond to our reminders, we may email you. This doesn't necessarily mean anything is wrong.</p>
<p>You can stop these emails at any time with the "Don't want these emails?" link in any message from us.</p>
{% endblock %}
